    Bug 2061047 - Fix bct2 failures part 2 - Make calendar task view actions accessible to keyboard users. r=aleca

    The task action controls sit in a custom toolbar. Expose the toolbar semantics and make the toolbar buttons focusable so the you can interact with priority, completion, and delete actions via keyboard.

    The task tree double-click in browser_taskView.js targets the internal XUL treechildren frame directly, so the test scopes mustHaveAccessibleRule off around only that synthetic event.

    TB-Tools-Id: 8bb1ea48-c119-4095-be3c-8ddf488375d2

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316875

